<title>USA: Rexene says it is not against $16/shr offer.</title>
<headline>Rexene says it is not against $16/shr offer.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rexene Corp said Wednesday that in response to recent comments from Jon Huntsman, Rexene reiterated that it would not oppose an all-cash, fully-financed offer to purchase the company for $16 per share from Mr. Huntsman or any other party.</p>
</text>
